    <string name="how_it_works_info">
        &lt;p>
        Surprise items is a format where a set of items are each sold at random —
        the buyer finds out which of the items they will receive live.
        You can see all available items in this format in the Items tab.
        &lt;/p>

        &lt;h3>What To Expect?&lt;/h3>

        &lt;p>Surprise Sets go through two main stages:&lt;/p>

        &lt;h4>⏳ Filling + Running&lt;/h4>
        &lt;p>
        The excitement begins! This is the time when you can purchase a surprise item.
        You can always see how many spots are left and what items have been sold.
        &lt;/p>

        &lt;h4>✅ Completed&lt;/h4>
        &lt;p>
        The sale is over. All of the available items have been sold and revealed,
        and the seller will ship to you as soon as they can.
        &lt;/p>
    </string>
